answers.approach:
Hush now, no grand MMM shall name the winning light;
I’ll start with trusted sales and levers we can randomize at night.

With ghost ads, bid switchbacks, and holdouts small and slow,
We’ll pool their lift by changing regime, not claim what they don’t show.

Then bound each channel’s credit, with drift alarms around;
Test models on blinded lift before their claims are crowned.

Where platforms hide the treatment, truth may never glow;
We’ll narrow what is plausible, but still not fully know.
